stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR

    state "Flagged before generation" as FLAGGED
    state "Excluded from the Regular return" as EXCLUDED
    state "Escalated before the M plus 4 deadline" as ESCALATED
    state "Seeded, Supplementary prepared" as SEEDED
    state "Closed" as CLOSED

    [*] --> FLAGGED: EX1 readiness finds an unseeded or missing UAN in a locked month
    FLAGGED --> CLOSED: EX3 seeding evidence approved before generation, line included
    FLAGGED --> EXCLUDED: EX2 Regular return generated without the line
    EXCLUDED --> SEEDED: EX4 seeding evidence recorded and checked
    EXCLUDED --> ESCALATED: EX6 escalation lead reached, still unseeded
    ESCALATED --> ESCALATED: EX7 approver decision recorded
    ESCALATED --> SEEDED: EX4 seeding evidence recorded and checked
    SEEDED --> CLOSED: EX5 Supplementary approved and paid, interest captured
    EXCLUDED --> EXCLUDED: EX8 member exits, record stays open with a leaver flag

    note right of EXCLUDED
        The employee is paid in the same run.
        Operator and employee notices go out.
        The employee share follows the tenant
        setting chosen at setup.
    end note

    note right of ESCALATED
        Month M plus 4 Regular return cannot be
        filed until a Supplementary for month M
        carries the member. The product shows it,
        records the decision, never blocks payroll.
    end note
